ault branch; on another branch, numbering says why it waits.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1794311873,"data":{"issue":"30308be9e50a7b6a68a1e4c3aba81d8295f30b54","field":"status","value":"closed"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1794311873,"data":{"issue":"30308be9e50a7b6a68a1e4c3aba81d8295f30b54","field":"labels","value":"feat"}}]}